      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1732956185025,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Case 2: Exact Location After Shifting\nOverview:\nIn this scenario, a tile shifts to its exact intended location. \nThis is the ideal outcome, but it is expected to occur infrequently.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Case 2: Exact Location After Shifting\nOverview:\nIn this scenario, a tile shifts to its exact intended location. \nThis is the ideal outcome, but it is expected to occur infrequently.",
